        "TileImage": "$($repository c8f1e97e-02e8-46bf-942b-80660e244914).Image",
        "Description": "A contract has been issued, and you have been cleared to engage. Eliminate any targets as cleanly as possible, avoiding collateral damage as far as possible.\r47, Sophus Fatale has infiltrated the event being held in Paris. He and his allies are planning to aid Dalia Margolis in gaining a list of powerful individuals to blackmail. Our client would rather he never has the chance to tell her so ensure he stays quiet.",
